Date: {{ date }}

To,
{{ pio_name }}
{{ department_name }}
{{ department_address }}

Subject: Application under the Right to Information Act, 2005

Respected Sir/Madam,

I, {{ applicant_name }}, a citizen of India, hereby submit this application under Section 6(1) of the Right to Information Act, 2005, seeking information as detailed below:

APPLICANT DETAILS:

Name: {{ applicant_name }}
Address: {{ applicant_address }}
Phone: {{ applicant_phone }}
Email: {{ applicant_email }}

INFORMATION SOUGHT:

I request the following information:

{{ information_sought }}

PERIOD OF INFORMATION:

The information requested pertains to the period: {{ period_of_information }}

{% if purpose %}
PURPOSE OF INFORMATION:

The purpose for which this information is sought is: {{ purpose }}

(Note: Under Section 6(2) of the RTI Act, the applicant is not required to provide reasons for requesting information. However, this is provided for your reference.)
{% endif %}

PREFERRED MODE OF RECEIVING INFORMATION:

I would prefer to receive the information in the following format: {{ preferred_format }}

Options: Photocopies / Certified Copies / Inspection of Records / Electronic Format (Email/CD)

{% if bpl_status %}
FEE EXEMPTION:

I belong to Below Poverty Line (BPL) category and am therefore exempt from paying the application fee under Section 7(5) of the RTI Act. A copy of my BPL certificate is attached herewith.
{% else %}
APPLICATION FEE:

I am enclosing the application fee of {{ application_fee }} in the form of:
□ Cash
□ Demand Draft No. _______ dated _______ drawn on _______
□ Indian Postal Order No. _______ dated _______
□ Court Fee Stamp
□ Online Payment (Transaction ID: _______)
{% endif %}

LEGAL PROVISIONS:

This application is made under the Right to Information Act, 2005, which mandates:

1. Under Section 7(1), information shall be provided within 30 days from the date of receipt of the application.

2. Under Section 7(1) proviso, if the information concerns the life or liberty of a person, it shall be provided within 48 hours.

3. Under Section 7(5), if information is not provided within the stipulated period, it shall be deemed to be provided free of cost.

4. Under Section 7(6), if the PIO fails to provide information within the time limit, a penalty of ₹250 per day (subject to a maximum of ₹25,000) may be imposed.

REQUEST FOR TIMELY RESPONSE:

I request you to kindly provide the information sought within the time limit prescribed under the RTI Act, 2005. If the information sought is held by another public authority, I request you to transfer this application to the concerned authority under Section 6(3) of the Act and inform me accordingly.

If any part of the information requested is exempt from disclosure under Section 8 or 9 of the Act, I request you to provide the remaining information after severing the exempt portions, as per Section 10 of the Act.

CONTACT FOR CLARIFICATION:

If any clarification is required regarding this application, please feel free to contact me at the above-mentioned phone number or email address.

I look forward to receiving the requested information at the earliest.

Thanking you,

Yours faithfully,

{{ applicant_name }}

